{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Cursed!: Reflection ignores dodged and fully absorbed hits",
  "contract": [
    "Issue #10788. Reflection reads the final damage after the hit roll and absorbs. With Major",
    "Reflection 901852 on the player, each of three single swings against the dodge fixture (100%, set again",
    "before every swing because the fixture writes m_realDodge and does not survive a dodge recalculation) is",
    "dodged and reflects nothing; then swings a Power Word: Shield 48066 absorbs completely (its remaining absorb",
    "goes down) deal no damage and reflect nothing. Positions and facing are recorded around the dodge swings."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 400000,
